{"status":"completed","summary":"node1 now serves a legacy-compatible Python web application from a chroot on port 8080 as the locked, non-login appsvc account. It starts automatically through SysV init and recovered successfully after a full node reboot.","actions_performed":["Created the locked appsvc system account with /bin/false as its shell.","Built a root-owned chroot at /srv/app-chroot using the installed Python 2.5 runtime.","Installed the web application and exposed its health endpoint on port 8080.","Created and enabled /etc/init.d/chroot-web for runlevels 2–5.","Restarted node1 safely and verified automatic service and data recovery."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Web application serves on node1 port 8080","command_ids":["cmd-6e06889dc1774743","cmd-6a90e0d6d39844f2"],"summary":"Port 8080 is listening and requests to $NODE_IP return HTTP 200 with status=healthy before and after reboot."},{"requirement":"Application runs inside a chroot as unprivileged appsvc","command_ids":["cmd-cb799bf504c7436b","cmd-6a90e0d6d39844f2","cmd-765189ffce544e38"],"summary":"The live process has UID 105/GID 499, PPID 1, and /proc/<pid>/root resolves to /srv/app-chroot. appsvc remains locked with /bin/false."},{"requirement":"Application starts at boot without an interactive login session","command_ids":["cmd-dd31d18141094346","cmd-6a90e0d6d39844f2","cmd-765189ffce544e38"],"summary":"SysV startup links are installed, the service returned automatically in runlevel 2 after reboot, PPID is 1, and no interactive sessions are present."},{"requirement":"Installed legacy OS release and kernel retained","command_ids":["cmd-971e8fc92d964160","cmd-765189ffce544e38"],"summary":"The node remains Ubuntu 7.10 running kernel 2.6.22-14-generic."},{"requirement":"Mandatory node1 restart and recovery","command_ids":["cmd-cb799bf504c7436b","cmd-979098f374ad4b4c","cmd-61ad4b2694b3469f","cmd-6a90e0d6d39844f2"],"summary":"Healthy baseline used boot ID 69efa0a1-5b5d-4f73-b7a4-ff34f9f0ab07; reboot ackn